<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #1a3a1a;"><td style="padding:6px;">400-499</td><td style="padding:6px;">Client Error</td><td style="padding:6px;">400 Bad Request, 401 Unauthorized, 403 Forbidden, 404 Not Found, 409 Conflict, 422 Unprocessable, 429 Too Many Requests</td></tr>
